/*!
\page page_sthltrack StHltTrack

\brief HLT reconstructed charged-particle track (global or primary) from the STAR online farm.

\section overview Overview

`StHltTrack` represents a single charged-particle track reconstructed by the STAR High Level
Trigger (HLT) online farm. Tracks may be global (not constrained to vertex) or primary
(re-fitted through the vertex). The class stores helix parameters describing the curved trajectory
in the STAR solenoidal magnetic field, the number of TPC hits, mean dE/dx, fit quality (χ²),
and momentum. Objects are collected in \ref StHltEvent and referenced by \ref StHltTrackNode,
\ref StHltHighPt, \ref StHltHeavyFragment, and \ref StHltDiElectron.

\section hierarchy Class Hierarchy

\code
TObject
└── StObject
    └── StHltTrack
\endcode

\section datamembers Data Members

| Type | Name | Description |
|------|------|-------------|
| `StTrackType` | `mType` | Track type: global or primary |
| `int` | `mId` | Unique track identifier within this event |
| `unsigned int` | `mFlag` | Track quality and status flags |
| `int` | `mInnerMostRow` | Innermost TPC pad row in fit |
| `int` | `mOuterMostRow` | Outermost TPC pad row in fit |
| `unsigned int` | `mNHits` | Number of TPC hits on track |
| `unsigned int` | `mNdedx` | Hits used in dE/dx calculation |
| `int` | `mQ` | Electric charge: +1 or −1 |
| `float[2]` | `mChi2` | χ² of momentum fit |
| `float` | `mDedx` | Mean dE/dx energy loss (GeV/cm) |
| `float` | `mPt` | Transverse momentum (GeV/c) |
| `float` | `mPhi0` | Azimuthal angle φ₀ of reference point (rad) |
| `float` | `mPsi` | Azimuthal momentum angle ψ (rad) |
| `float` | `mR0` | Radial coordinate of reference point (cm) |
| `float` | `mTanl` | tan λ = pz/pT |
| `float` | `mZ0` | z of reference point (cm) |
| `float` | `mLength` | Track arc length (cm) |
| `float` | `mDpt` | Uncertainty on pT (GeV/c) |

\section keymethods Key Methods

| Signature | Description |
|-----------|-------------|
| `StTrackType type() const` | Track type (global or primary) |
| `int id() const` | Unique track identifier |
| `unsigned int nHits() const` | Number of TPC hits |
| `int q() const` | Charge sign (+1 or −1) |
| `float chi2(int i) const` | χ²[i] of fit |
| `float dedx() const` | Mean dE/dx (GeV/cm) |
| `float pt() const` | Transverse momentum (GeV/c) |
| `float tanl() const` | tan λ = pz/pT |
| `float z0() const` | z of reference point (cm) |
| `float length() const` | Arc length (cm) |

\section example Usage Example

\code{.cpp}
const StSPtrVecHltTrack& gTracks = hlt->globalTrack();
for (size_t i = 0; i < gTracks.size(); ++i) {
    const StHltTrack* tr = gTracks[i];
    cout << "pT=" << tr->pt() << " dEdx=" << tr->dedx() << endl;
}
\endcode

\see StHltEvent
\see StHltTrackNode
\see StHltHighPt
\see StHltHeavyFragment
\see StHltDiElectron
*/
